    {
      "id": 930000000032,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / CHANCE HOLD FM DRIFT\n\nPlay MIDI notes to hear the FM Voice output.\nChance Hold free-runs at 1 Hz. Each clock has\n75% probability of a new random CV sample;\nrejected clocks preserve the previous timbre.\n\nSMOOTH output modulates FM Voice INDEX CV.\nGLIDE=0.4 s makes timbre changes fluid.\nQUANTIZE=ON rounds random steps to 1/12 V;\nRATE/CLOCK/RESET accept CV and triggers.\n\nTry CHANCE 100% for dense motion, or 20%\nfor sparse events. Watch FM aliasing at very\nhigh pitch/index. Keep monitor level low.\n\nData-validated source graph only, host untested.\n",
        "width": 29
      },
      "pos": [
        69,
        0
      ]
